Steps for acquiring a Wwise license:
 - Create an account on the Audiokinetic website: https://www.audiokinetic.com.
 - Go to this page: http://www.audiokinetic.com/school/.
 - Go to the Witcher 3 REDkit Modding section and press the Request Access button.
 - You will get a notification once your request has been accepted.
 - This course will provide you with a license key to use on your mod.
 - If you continue to need access past the 3 month mark, you simply request access again.
 - When you receive your own license, then you can open up the w3_audio project with WWISE, and then you can insert it with WWISE's "License Manager...".

Happy audio modding ^_^
